    "show_share": true,
    "description": "One of the key responsibilities of a leader is to develop the people who work with us, to push them to new heights, and to ensure succession planning. For the very first time in AKU, the Internal Medicine service line, in partnership with CIME, conducted a clinical simulation programme to enhance team leadership skills. The Programme was intended for senior registered nurses and team leaders working in the field of internal medicine who play a significant role in the absence of head nurses or management.",
